WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.204
Mercury.

00:01.904 --> 00:08.163
The smallest planet and the closest to the Sun, so it never strays far from the Sun in our sky.

00:08.613 --> 00:12.472
It shows only low in the twilight, for a few weeks at a time.

00:12.922 --> 00:17.105
One day here, from sunrise to sunrise, lasts two of its years.
